 runs the job in a separate thread with its own event loop, but\nthe ``new_log_evt`` waiters live in the daemon loop. ``asyncio.Event.set()`` is\nnot thread-safe, so without hopping back onto the daemon loop the terminal DONE\nnotification is lost and ``ws_poll_info`` hangs forever (the desktop app's\n&quot;finalizing&quot; step never completes and the connection eventually drops).\n``from_threadpool`` mimics sync routes (``/update/start``), which call\n``run_command`` from FastAPI's threadpool, with no running loop.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"001d7db05b99187760d8c977ec2398af","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"234d4be8a261a92f140d9497084bd3b6","type":"before","name":"tmp_path_factory","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"ae617ba78296a2dd4e3a63ed74f65927","type":"before","name":"_isolated_hf_credentials","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"fd9a2efe6b8f415c9767fd2808f818a3","type":"before","name":"_no_telemetry","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"e72ca2f46444cbf8902c8fecd40a06db","type":"before","name":"monkeypatch","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"38f0947c1f1225c02654ce9d934963f4","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"f0366830ca56d446247bd20061ba2f75","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"5bd5580a0e0e6adf969394a6b434e313","type":"after","name":"monkeypatch::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[{"id":"5facd13f1772fab6326d2152751ad1d9","name":"test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread[True]","fullName":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register#test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread","environment":"default","status":"passed","retries":[],"start":1794845634313,"stop":1794845634417,"duration":104,"labels":[{"name":"tag","value":"as